{
  "lines": [
    { "index": 1, "start": "00:00", "en": "The Bear and the Bee", "zh": "熊和蜜蜂" },
    { "index": 2, "start": "00:03", "en": "(", "zh": "（" },
    { "index": 3, "start": "00:05", "en": "Everybody knows that bears love honey.", "zh": "谁都知道，熊最爱吃蜂蜜。" },
    { "index": 4, "start": "00:09", "en": "One day Mr Bear looks in his cupboard and he can't find any honey.", "zh": "一天，熊先生在橱柜里找了找，一点蜂蜜也没找到。" },
    { "index": 5, "start": "00:16", "en": "\"Oh no!", "zh": "“糟糕！" },
    { "index": 6, "start": "00:18", "en": "No honey!\"", "zh": "没有蜂蜜了！”" },
    { "index": 7, "start": "00:20", "en": "he says.", "zh": "他说。" },
    { "index": 8, "start": "00:22", "en": "So he goes into the forest to find some.", "zh": "于是他走进森林去找蜂蜜。" },
    { "index": 9, "start": "00:27", "en": "He sees a beehive in a tree.", "zh": "他看见树上有一个蜂巢。" },
    { "index": 10, "start": "00:31", "en": "He smells the honey.", "zh": "他闻到了蜂蜜的香味。" },
    { "index": 11, "start": "00:34", "en": "\"Mmmmm!", "zh": "“嗯——" },
    { "index": 12, "start": "00:36", "en": "Honey!\"", "zh": "是蜂蜜！”" },
    { "index": 13, "start": "00:39", "en": "He sticks his paw into the beehive and… ZZZZZZZZZ!", "zh": "他把爪子伸进蜂巢，然后……嗡嗡嗡嗡嗡！" },
    { "index": 14, "start": "00:45", "en": "A bee flies out.", "zh": "一只蜜蜂飞了出来。" },
    { "index": 15, "start": "00:48", "en": "“Hey, bear!", "zh": "“喂，狗熊！" },
    { "index": 16, "start": "00:50", "en": "Go away!", "zh": "走开！" },
    { "index": 17, "start": "00:52", "en": "” says the bee.", "zh": "”蜜蜂说。" },
    { "index": 18, "start": "00:54", "en": "\"This is not your honey!\"", "zh": "“这蜂蜜不是你的！”" },
    { "index": 19, "start": "00:58", "en": "Mr Bear is annoyed.", "zh": "熊先生很恼火。" },
    { "index": 20, "start": "01:01", "en": "“I am bigger than you,” he says.", "zh": "“我比你大，”他说。" },
    { "index": 21, "start": "01:05", "en": "“And I am stronger than you too.", "zh": "“我也比你强壮。" },
    { "index": 22, "start": "01:08", "en": "I can do what I want!", "zh": "我想干什么就干什么！" },
    { "index": 23, "start": "01:11", "en": "Now...", "zh": "现在……" },
    { "index": 24, "start": "01:13", "en": "buzz off!", "zh": "给我滚开！" },
    { "index": 25, "start": "01:15", "en": "” Mr Bear sticks his paw into the beehive again and… ZZZZZZZZZ!", "zh": "”熊先生又把爪子伸进蜂巢，然后……嗡嗡嗡嗡嗡！" },
    { "index": 26, "start": "01:22", "en": "ZING!", "zh": "嗖！" },
    { "index": 27, "start": "01:24", "en": "OWIE!", "zh": "哎哟！" },
    { "index": 28, "start": "01:26", "en": "The bee stings him right on his nose!", "zh": "蜜蜂正好蜇在他的鼻子上！" },
    { "index": 29, "start": "01:31", "en": "“My nose!", "zh": "“我的鼻子！" },
    { "index": 30, "start": "01:33", "en": "My nose!", "zh": "我的鼻子！" },
    { "index": 31, "start": "01:35", "en": "Oooh...", "zh": "哎哟……" },
    { "index": 32, "start": "01:37", "en": "I'm so angry!\"", "zh": "我气死了！”" },
    { "index": 33, "start": "01:40", "en": "growls Mr Bear.", "zh": "熊先生吼道。" },
    { "index": 34, "start": "01:43", "en": "He finds a big stick.", "zh": "他找来一根大棍子。" },
    { "index": 35, "start": "01:46", "en": "He tries to hit the bee.", "zh": "他想要打那只蜜蜂。" },
    { "index": 36, "start": "01:49", "en": "He swings and he swings, but the bee is too fast!", "zh": "他挥了又挥，可蜜蜂飞得太快了！" },
    { "index": 37, "start": "01:55", "en": "Mr Bear gets angrier and angrier.", "zh": "熊先生越来越生气。" },
    { "index": 38, "start": "02:00", "en": "\"GARRRRRGHH!", "zh": "“吼——！" },
    { "index": 39, "start": "02:02", "en": "I WILL SQUASH YOU!", "zh": "我要把你拍扁！" },
    { "index": 40, "start": "02:04", "en": "COME HERE!\"", "zh": "你给我过来！”" },
    { "index": 41, "start": "02:07", "en": "The bee flies back into the beehive.", "zh": "蜜蜂飞回了蜂巢里。" },
    { "index": 42, "start": "02:10", "en": "\"AH HAH!", "zh": "“啊哈！" },
    { "index": 43, "start": "02:12", "en": "Now you're trapped!\"", "zh": "这下你跑不掉了！”" },
    { "index": 44, "start": "02:14", "en": "yells Mr Bear.", "zh": "熊先生大叫。" },
    { "index": 45, "start": "02:17", "en": "He swings his stick at the beehive.", "zh": "他举起棍子朝蜂巢挥去。" },
    { "index": 46, "start": "02:21", "en": "Smash!", "zh": "砰！" },
    { "index": 47, "start": "02:23", "en": "Smash!", "zh": "砰！" },
    { "index": 48, "start": "02:25", "en": "Smash!", "zh": "砰！" },
    { "index": 49, "start": "02:27", "en": "He smashes it to pieces!", "zh": "他把蜂巢砸成了碎片！" },
    { "index": 50, "start": "02:31", "en": "Then he hears a strange sound.", "zh": "接着他听见一个奇怪的声音。" },
    { "index": 51, "start": "02:35", "en": "It gets louder and louder… ZZZZ!", "zh": "声音越来越大……嗡嗡！" },
    { "index": 52, "start": "02:39", "en": "ZZZZ!", "zh": "嗡嗡！" },
    { "index": 53, "start": "02:41", "en": "ZZZ!", "zh": "嗡！" },
    { "index": 54, "start": "02:43", "en": "Zzzz!", "zh": "嗡……" },
    { "index": 55, "start": "02:45", "en": "ZZZZZZZZZZ!", "zh": "嗡嗡嗡嗡嗡！" },
    { "index": 56, "start": "02:48", "en": "Zzzz!", "zh": "嗡……" },
    { "index": 57, "start": "02:50", "en": "ZZZZ!", "zh": "嗡嗡！" },
    { "index": 58, "start": "02:53", "en": "Thousands of bees fly out of the smashed beehive.", "zh": "成千上万只蜜蜂从被砸烂的蜂巢里飞了出来。" },
    { "index": 59, "start": "02:59", "en": "They fly around Mr Bear's head… ZZZZZZZZZ… ZING!", "zh": "它们绕着熊先生的头飞……嗡嗡嗡嗡嗡……嗖！" },
    { "index": 60, "start": "03:06", "en": "They sting him on his ear.", "zh": "它们蜇了他的耳朵。" },
    { "index": 61, "start": "03:09", "en": "ZING ZING!", "zh": "嗖！嗖！" },
    { "index": 62, "start": "03:11", "en": "They sting him on his elbow.", "zh": "它们蜇了他的胳膊肘。" },
    { "index": 63, "start": "03:14", "en": "They chase Mr Bear through the forest.", "zh": "它们追着熊先生穿过森林。" },
    { "index": 64, "start": "03:18", "en": "They sting him on his arms, his legs, his hands...", "zh": "它们蜇他的胳膊、他的腿、他的手……" },
    { "index": 65, "start": "03:23", "en": "and especially on his nose.", "zh": "尤其是他的鼻子。" },
    { "index": 66, "start": "03:26", "en": "ZING!", "zh": "嗖！" },
    { "index": 67, "start": "03:28", "en": "ZING!", "zh": "嗖！" },
    { "index": 68, "start": "03:30", "en": "ZING!", "zh": "嗖！" },
    { "index": 69, "start": "03:32", "en": "Mr Bear runs all the way home and slams the door shut.", "zh": "熊先生一路跑回家，砰地关上了门。" },
    { "index": 70, "start": "03:38", "en": "BAM!", "zh": "砰！" },
    { "index": 71, "start": "03:40", "en": "Then he hears a voice behind him.", "zh": "然后他听见身后有个声音。" },
    { "index": 72, "start": "03:44", "en": "It’s Mrs.", "zh": "是熊" },
    { "index": 73, "start": "03:45", "en": "Bear.", "zh": "太太。" },
    { "index": 74, "start": "03:47", "en": "“You did it again, didn’t you?", "zh": "“你又这样了，是不是？" },
    { "index": 75, "start": "03:50", "en": "” she says.", "zh": "”她说。" },
    { "index": 76, "start": "03:52", "en": "“You lost your temper.", "zh": "“你又发脾气了。" },
    { "index": 77, "start": "03:55", "en": "” “Yes,” he says as he cries and counts his bee stings.", "zh": "”“是的，”他一边哭一边数着自己被蜇了多少下。" },
    { "index": 78, "start": "04:01", "en": "“Here’s the bee-sting medicine,” says Mrs.", "zh": "“这是治蜂蜇的药，”熊" },
    { "index": 79, "start": "04:04", "en": "Bear.", "zh": "太太说。" },
    { "index": 80, "start": "04:06", "en": "“Also, we have honey in the cupboard.", "zh": "“还有，我们橱柜里是有蜂蜜的。" },
    { "index": 81, "start": "04:10", "en": "It’s behind the flour.", "zh": "就在面粉后面。" },
    { "index": 82, "start": "04:13", "en": "”", "zh": "”" },
    { "index": 83, "start": "04:15", "en": "Moral: A hot temper always gets you into trouble.", "zh": "寓意：脾气一上来，准会惹麻烦。" }
  ]
}
